<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  CONTAGION_MECHANICS_BUILD_1 — Contagion-touched and its mutation deck.

  Owner rulings (verbatim):
    N4 (2026-10-15)  "Bloom time, stronger in burn, and contact."
    Q3 (2026-10-15)  "Stops current mutations. No protection if you get exposed again later."
    deck (2026-09-12, research/mutation_systems_survey_2026-09-11.md "THE DECK IS RULED")
                     "It should be a large variance experience that's 50% all negative and 50% positive + negative.
                      The Contagion isn't nice."  + a CUSTOM unstable gene + Contagion-added parts copy the existing
                      removal risk (cut one off and an Unfinished gets out).
    sheet §6 ban 6   Contagion-touched never upgrades you.

  RM_ContagionTouched is the PROGRESSION, nothing else: severity is the exposure the pawn has soaked up (doses in
  HediffCompProperties_RM_ContagionTouched; RM_MapComponent_ContagionTouch applies them). It never fades on its own:
  only the Sunbeam arrest removes it (Source/RM_SunbeamArrest.cs, DamageWorker_RM_UV). From severity 0.1 the pawn
  mutates at a mean of 6 days / severity; at most 6 mutations, one of each card.

  THE DECK is every HediffDef/GeneDef below carrying RimMandrake.Contagion.RM_ContagionMutationExtension. Each card
  writes its benefits and costs in words; RM_ContagionMutationExtension.ConfigErrors refuses a benefit-only card, an
  all-negative card with a benefit, and a mixed card with no benefit (the never-upgrade law, checked at load).
  All-negative half: weeping lesions, nerve misfires, fused hand (part), unstable genome (gene).
  Mixed half: thickened hide, budded eyes, racing blood, hook claw (part).
  Every number here is this build's INVENTED first-pass tuning; every one is a vanilla field, so tuning is XML only.
  Simplest-default choices taken without an owner ruling are listed on the item (rimflow note, 2026-10-16).
-->
<Defs>

  <HediffDef>
    <defName>RM_ContagionTouched</defName>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <label>Contagion-touched</label>
    <labelNoun>the Contagion's touch</labelNoun>
    <description>The Contagion's spores have taken root. The body has started changing, and it will keep changing, more and faster the more of the storm it soaks up: some of the changes are pure harm, the rest give something and always take something.\n\nNothing undoes a change once it has grown. A Helix sunbeam can stop the process: hold the lens on the patient, or hit them with it. That gives no protection; the next exposure starts it again.</description>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.80, 0.25, 0.32)</defaultLabelColor>
    <isBad>true</isBad>
    <initialSeverity>0.001</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1.0</maxSeverity>
    <scenarioCanAdd>false</scenarioCanAdd>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.HediffCompProperties_RM_ContagionTouched">
        <bloomDosePerPoll>0.0005</bloomDosePerPoll>
        <burnDosePerPoll>0.004</burnDosePerPoll>
        <contactDosePerPoll>0.01</contactDosePerPoll>
        <contactSources>
          <li>RM_TheUnfinished</li>
          <li>RM_Coalescence</li>
        </contactSources>
        <minSeverityToMutate>0.1</minSeverityToMutate>
        <mtbDaysAtFull>6</mtbDaysAtFull>
        <mutationCap>6</mutationCap>
        <allNegativeShare>0.5</allNegativeShare>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>brushed</label>
        <minSeverity>0</minSeverity>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>changing</label>
        <minSeverity>0.1</minSeverity>
        <painOffset>0.02</painOffset>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>changing fast</label>
        <minSeverity>0.5</minSeverity>
        <painOffset>0.05</painOffset>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
            <offset>-0.03</offset>
          </li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- ───────────── the deck: whole-body cards ───────────── -->

  <HediffDef Name="RM_ContagionMutationBase" Abstract="True">
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>true</isBad>
    <scenarioCanAdd>false</scenarioCanAdd>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.72, 0.24, 0.34)</defaultLabelColor>
  </HediffDef>

  <HediffDef ParentName="RM_ContagionMutationBase">
    <defName>RM_ContagionWeepingLesions</defName>
    <label>weeping lesions</label>
    <description>Patches of skin that never close, weeping a thin red fluid. They hurt, they look terrible, and they let sickness in.</description>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <painOffset>0.08</painOffset>
        <statOffsets>
          <PawnBeauty>-1</PawnBeauty>
          <ImmunityGainSpeed>-0.1</ImmunityGainSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.RM_ContagionMutationExtension">
        <allNegative>true</allNegative>
        <costs>
          <li>pain</li>
          <li>ugliness</li>
          <li>slower immunity</li>
        </costs>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </HediffDef>

  <HediffDef ParentName="RM_ContagionMutationBase">
    <defName>RM_ContagionNerveMisfire</defName>
    <label>nerve misfires</label>
    <description>Nerves that grew in the wrong order. Hands twitch, a leg sometimes forgets it is a leg.</description>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Manipulation</capacity>
            <offset>-0.1</offset>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Moving</capacity>
            <offset>-0.05</offset>
          </li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
    </stages>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.RM_ContagionMutationExtension">
        <allNegative>true</allNegative>
        <costs>
          <li>manipulation</li>
          <li>moving</li>
        </costs>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </HediffDef>

  <HediffDef ParentName="RM_ContagionMutationBase">
    <defName>RM_ContagionThickHide</defName>
    <label>thickened hide</label>
    <description>The skin has grown thick and plated, like the Contagion's armored natives. It turns a blade, and it is heavy, stiff and hideous.</description>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.12</ArmorRating_Sharp>
          <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.08</ArmorRating_Blunt>
          <MoveSpeed>-0.25</MoveSpeed>
          <PawnBeauty>-1</PawnBeauty>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.RM_ContagionMutationExtension">
        <allNegative>false</allNegative>
        <benefits>
          <li>sharp and blunt armor</li>
        </benefits>
        <costs>
          <li>move speed</li>
          <li>ugliness</li>
        </costs>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </HediffDef>

  <HediffDef ParentName="RM_ContagionMutationBase">
    <defName>RM_ContagionBuddedEyes</defName>
    <label>budded eyes</label>
    <description>Small extra eyes have budded along the brow and temples. They see well. They never close, and the pawn never quite stops seeing.</description>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Sight</capacity>
            <offset>0.15</offset>
          </li>
        </capMods>
        <statOffsets>
          <MentalBreakThreshold>0.05</MentalBreakThreshold>
          <PawnBeauty>-1</PawnBeauty>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.RM_ContagionMutationExtension">
        <allNegative>false</allNegative>
        <benefits>
          <li>sight</li>
        </benefits>
        <costs>
          <li>mental break threshold</li>
          <li>ugliness</li>
        </costs>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </HediffDef>

  <HediffDef ParentName="RM_ContagionMutationBase">
    <defName>RM_ContagionRacingBlood</defName>
    <label>racing blood</label>
    <description>The blood runs hot and fast, like the Contagion's own. Wounds close at a visible rate, and the body is always starving.</description>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <hungerRateFactorOffset>0.4</hungerRateFactorOffset>
        <statOffsets>
          <InjuryHealingFactor>0.5</InjuryHealingFactor>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.RM_ContagionMutationExtension">
        <allNegative>false</allNegative>
        <benefits>
          <li>injury healing</li>
        </benefits>
        <costs>
          <li>hunger</li>
        </costs>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- ───────────── the deck: part cards (removal lets an Unfinished out) ───────────── -->

  <HediffDef Name="RM_ContagionPartMutationBase" Abstract="True">
    <hediffClass>Hediff_AddedPart</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <scenarioCanAdd>false</scenarioCanAdd>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.72, 0.24, 0.34)</defaultLabelColor>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.HediffCompProperties_UnfinishedEmerge">
        <emergeKind>RM_TheUnfinished</emergeKind>
        <letterLabel>The growth comes away</letterLabel>
        <letterText>Cutting the Contagion's growth off {PAWN_nameDef} has let the thing inside finish its thought. It has torn loose and walked off as one of the Unfinished, and it is not friendly.</letterText>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </HediffDef>

  <HediffDef ParentName="RM_ContagionPartMutationBase">
    <defName>RM_ContagionFusedHand</defName>
    <label>fused hand</label>
    <labelNoun>a fused hand</labelNoun>
    <description>The fingers have run together into one stiff, swollen paddle of flesh. It is barely a hand.\n\nIt has its own neural structures and may become dangerous if removed.</description>
    <addedPartProps>
      <partEfficiency>0.2</partEfficiency>
    </addedPartProps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <PawnBeauty>-1</PawnBeauty>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.RM_ContagionMutationExtension">
        <allNegative>true</allNegative>
        <installPart>Hand</installPart>
        <costs>
          <li>a near-useless hand</li>
          <li>ugliness</li>
          <li>removing it lets an Unfinished out</li>
        </costs>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </HediffDef>

  <HediffDef ParentName="RM_ContagionPartMutationBase">
    <defName>RM_ContagionHookClaw</defName>
    <label>hook claw</label>
    <labelNoun>a hook claw</labelNoun>
    <description>The hand has become a single hooked claw of bone, like an Unfinished's one finished limb. It tears flesh well and holds a tool badly.\n\nIt has its own neural structures and may become dangerous if removed.</description>
    <addedPartProps>
      <partEfficiency>0.5</partEfficiency>
    </addedPartProps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statOffsets>
          <PawnBeauty>-1</PawnBeauty>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HediffCompProperties_VerbGiver">
        <tools>
          <li>
            <label>hook claw</label>
            <capacities>
              <li>Cut</li>
            </capacities>
            <power>14</power>
            <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
          </li>
        </tools>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.RM_ContagionMutationExtension">
        <allNegative>false</allNegative>
        <installPart>Hand</installPart>
        <benefits>
          <li>a strong claw attack</li>
        </benefits>
        <costs>
          <li>half a hand for work</li>
          <li>ugliness</li>
          <li>removing it lets an Unfinished out</li>
        </costs>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- ───────────── the deck: the custom unstable gene (ruled 2026-09-12) ───────────── -->

  <GeneDef>
    <defName>RM_ContagionUnstableGenome</defName>
    <label>Contagion-unstable genome</label>
    <labelShortAdj>unstable</labelShortAdj>
    <description>The Contagion has written itself into this genome, badly. The body keeps half-starting repairs it never finishes: wounds close slowly, sickness takes longer to beat, and the mind frays under the strain.</description>
    <iconPath>UI/Icons/Genes/Gene_WeakImmunity</iconPath>
    <displayCategory>Miscellaneous</displayCategory>
    <canGenerateInGeneSet>false</canGenerateInGeneSet>
    <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
    <statFactors>
      <ImmunityGainSpeed>0.8</ImmunityGainSpeed>
      <InjuryHealingFactor>0.8</InjuryHealingFactor>
    </statFactors>
    <statOffsets>
      <MentalBreakThreshold>0.04</MentalBreakThreshold>
    </statOffsets>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.Contagion.RM_ContagionMutationExtension">
        <allNegative>true</allNegative>
        <costs>
          <li>slower immunity</li>
          <li>slower healing</li>
          <li>mental break threshold</li>
        </costs>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </GeneDef>

</Defs>
